   "updated": 1791906203453,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "③ WebSocket\nStarts as HTTP, upgrades once\n(101), then both sides send\nany time. For chat, live\nscores — anything the server\nmust push often.",
   "originalText": "③ WebSocket\nStarts as HTTP, upgrades once\n(101), then both sides send\nany time. For chat, live\nscores — anything the server\nmust push often.",
