   "updated": 1791906203453,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "④ Gateways are stateful\nA user is attached to one\ngateway. Fan out through\npub/sub so any API server can\nreach any connected user.",
   "originalText": "④ Gateways are stateful\nA user is attached to one\ngateway. Fan out through\npub/sub so any API server can\nreach any connected user.",
