   "locked": false,
   "text": "⑤ Pick the method\nRare updates: short polling.\nServer-only push: SSE. Both\nways, instant: WebSocket. Long\npolling: the fallback.",
   "originalText": "⑤ Pick the method\nRare updates: short polling.\nServer-only push: SSE. Both\nways, instant: WebSocket. Long\npolling: the fallback.",
